                    "null_values": [],
                    "refresh_rate": "",
                    "row": 29,
                    "text": "### Reading the coverage tiles\n\nEleven hosts make up the Test environment. The two tables to the right list the\nhosts that **are** covered by each layer — a host missing from one of them is a\nhost that layer cannot see.\n\n**Infrastructure agent** — the \"Hosts reporting\" tile above. Anything below 11\nmeans a host sends nothing at all.\n\n**Windows Services** — bundled with the agent, so a host that reports metrics but\nis absent from the services table only needs its config file and a restart.\n\n**`UE1-TEST-REDIS-A1` runs Ubuntu.** It needs the Linux agent, and neither the\nWindows Services integration nor the .NET agent applies to it, so it will never\nappear in those two tables.\n\n**The two SQL hosts need `nri-mssql`** on top of the agent for any database\nmetric. Its absence does not show up here at all — check the \"SQL Server\"\ndashboard.\n",
                    "title": "",
                    "units": [],
                    "width": 5,
                    "y_axis_left_max": 0,
                    "y_axis_left_min": 0
                  }
                ],
                "widget_pie": [],
                "widget_stacked_bar": [],
                "widget_table": [
                  {
                    "chart_styles": [],
                    "colors": [],
                    "column": 1,
                    "data_format": [],
                    "facet_show_other_series": false,
                    "filter_current_dashboard": false,
                    "height": 4,
                    "id": "568713138",
                    "ignore_time_range": false,
                    "initial_sorting": [],
                    "legend_enabled": true,
                    "linked_entity_guids": [],
                    "nrql_query": [
                      {
                        "account_id": "1468011",
                        "query": "SELECT latest(cpuPercent) AS 'CPU %', latest(memoryUsedBytes) * 100 / latest(memoryTotalBytes) AS 'Memory %', latest(uptime) / 86400 AS 'Uptime days', latest(agentVersion) AS 'Agent' FROM SystemSample WHERE hostname LIKE 'UE1-TEST%' AND hostname IN ({{hostname}}) FACET hostname LIMIT MAX"
                      }
                    ],
                    "null_values": [],
                    "refresh_rate": "",
                    "row": 5,
                    "threshold": [],
                    "title": "Host health",
                    "units": [],
                    "width": 6,
                    "y_axis_left_max": 0,
                    "y_axis_left_min": 0
                  },
